&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is the enterprise technology and transformation capability of WPP, delivering data, AI, and modern applications for the world&#39;s leading brands. We partner with AWS to bring these capabilities to blue-chip clients. WPP Enterprise Solutions signed a multi-year Strategic Collaboration Agreement with AWS, and we are building toward AWS Premier Partner status. This role sits at the centre of that growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are hiring the senior technical voice of our AWS alliance in EMEA. This is the person AWS field leadership and client architects turn to when a deal needs technical credibility, and the person who shapes how we win on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will own the technical strategy behind our co-sell pursuits: the reference architectures that become client blueprints, the proof points that remove doubt, and the joint solutions that define our AWS partnership. This is a hands-on principal role for someone who wants their architecture decisions to carry weight across a fast-growing alliance, not a task-based delivery seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a principal-level technical pre-sales role. You are the senior technical authority for AWS co-sell across EMEA. You partner directly with Alliance Sales, Alliance Solution Leads, AWS Solutions Architects, and client engineering teams to win strategic pursuits. You set the technical direction, and you bring the depth to back it up in the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is an individual contributor role with senior influence. You will mentor delivery teams and shape technical standards, but your primary impact is winning the pursuits that grow the alliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership on strategic pursuits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;serve as the senior technical partner on priority AWS co-sell opportunities. Set the technical win strategy, lead client-facing deep-dives alongside AWS SAs, and remove the objections that decide competitive deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference architectures that become standards:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;design the architectures that anchor our joint AWS solutions and get reused across pursuits. Contribute to AWS Partner Central and establish the patterns delivery teams build from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof that converts:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;scope and lead the proof-of-concept work that proves we can deliver, and shape those POCs so they become production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS field relationships: &lt;/strong&gt;build trusted relationships with AWS Solutions Architects, Specialist SAs, and ProServe. Be the technical name AWS field teams want on their deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical direction for the alliance:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;advise our leadership and client leadership on AWS architecture strategy. Keep us ahead of AWS roadmaps in priority services, and set the technical bar as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Technical Depth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-46:73;3142-3588&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generative AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Bedrock, SageMaker, agentic and generative AI application patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Marketing Cloud (AMC), AWS Clean Rooms, data lakes, analytics pipelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Personalize, Amazon Connect, serverless architectures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Applications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lambda, Step Functions, API Gateway, container orchestration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Event-driven architectures, microservices, API design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;How Success Looks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-55:69;3612-4019&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Technical win rate on the strategic pursuits you lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Competitive deals turned in our favor by your technical credibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reference architectures adopted as reusable standards across the alliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;POC-to-production conversion on the engagements you shape&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strength of your working relationships with AWS field and specialist teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;The technical bar you set for delivery teams as the alliance grows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;61:1-65:90;4054-4484&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;5+ years in technical pre-sales, solution architecture, or technical consulting, with senior client-facing credibility&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Deep hands-on AWS expertise with a track record of delivered projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;A strong record leading demos and POCs that win competitive pursuits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Command of enterprise architecture patterns and the judgment to apply them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience in a Global Systems Integrator, agency, or professional services environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;69:1-74:47;4501-4917&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;AWS certifications: Solutions Architect Professional and specialty certifications (ML, Data Analytics)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Hands-on experience with Amazon Bedrock and generative AI implementations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Familiarity with Amazon Marketing Cloud (AMC) and advertising technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prior AWS partner-company or direct AWS experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience supporting co-sell motions with AWS field teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;Vertical compliance familiarity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Why This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will be in the room for the technical decisions that win AWS deals. You will build the architectures that become client solutions and the proof that tips competitive pursuits in our favor. As the alliance grows toward Premier Partner status, you will set the technical standard the whole team builds on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Your technical excellence directly drives AWS alliance revenue growth, and here it will be seen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Principal Consultant needed to join our Consultancy team at VML Enterprise Solutions.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary and distinguished&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to influence and drive transformation at the highest levels of our consultancy. This pivotal role offers a unique opportunity to act as a trusted advisor to C-suite global business leaders, shaping the future of our consultancy solutions on a global scale. As a senior figure within our organization, you will mentor and lead our clients and internal teams toward unparalleled success. Your profound industry expertise and collaborative leadership will be crucial in delivering impactful business outcomes, while your dedication to a people-first ethos will cultivate a culture of empowerment, growth, and continuous improvement across our Consultancy team and the entire Business Services department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other core elements of this role will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Orchestrating teams with diverse, cross-functional skill sets to collaboratively generate strategic, high-quality solutions to complex client challenges.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Demonstrating a relentless passion for deciphering and resolving intricate client problems within the dynamic and evolving digital landscape.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Proactively identifying new opportunities for client support by leveraging deep client insights and extending value beyond the initial engagements&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Utilizing advanced communication and analytical skills to swiftly dissect client issues, providing clear, actionable strategies in often ambiguous and high-pressure situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will have a distinguished consultancy background or an executive leadership position, demonstrating profound expertise in multiple specialized sectors. Ideally, your experience spans at least 1-2 key industries, such as retail, FMCG/CPG, B2B, or automotive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To highlight the seniority and scope of this role, consider these responsibilities and engagements comparable to the following positions: Consultancy Director, Consulting Manager, Lead Consultant, Senior Strategy Consultant, Head of Digital, Digital Director, Management Consultant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Management:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate at C-suite level to engage and lead clients through complex transformational change across truly omni-channel ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle the biggest transformational business questions that lead our clients to global success across experience, technology and organisational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional engagements, serving as the primary point of contact for senior client stakeholders across a number of our largest clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture strong, trusted relationships with clients, understanding their business challenges and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and pursue opportunities to expand existing client relationships and generate new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and coach the more junior consultants, fostering a collaborative and high-performing environment.&lt;br&gt;Inspire and empower team members to take ownership, develop their skills, and reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote knowledge sharing and best practices across the team and wider organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Consulting &amp;amp; Solution Delivery:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your expertise in eCommerce and specialist sector knowledge (e.g., retail, FMCG/CPG, B2B, automotive) to provide strategic guidance and solutions to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator who can articulately ask questions and actively listen to get to the core of the client problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being comfortable with ‘grey’, bringing clarity to ambiguous situations and utilising your advanced problem-solving capability to analyse complex business problems and independently overcome obstacles quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A lateral thinker who is able to step back to assess the client and ask from a broader perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough business analysis, identifying pain points, opportunities, and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of technologies that form a part of digital ecosystems, such as eCommerce platforms, CMS, PIM etc. as well as software delivery methodology including agile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and present compelling proposals, roadmaps, and presentations that clearly articulate value propositions and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the delivery function with business insights to help keep the business &amp;amp; team focussed on outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
